              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.32.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Nia 32.4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kit meno kabaka ocako yubo lok ci otiyo cal litino twoni aryo me jabu, ka owaco bot lwak ni, “Wun doŋ wubedo ka wirre wa i Jerucalem twatwal, meno doŋ oromowu, Doŋ wunen lubaŋawu, wun jo Icrael, ma yam gukwanyowu woko ki i lo bo Ejipt.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jeroboam oketo cal wod twon acel i Betel, ka dok oketo acel i Dan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.29"
            ]
          }
        }
